{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06630","headline":"贻阎处士防卜居终南 · 储光羲","name":"贻阎处士防卜居终南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风摇杂树，言别还江汜。\n坚冰生绿潭，又客三千里。\n兆梦唯颜色，悬情乃文史。\n涤耳贵清言，披欢迟玉趾。\n秦城疑旧庐，伫立问焉如。\n稚子跪而说，还山将隐居。\n竹林既深远，松宇复清虚。\n迹逈事多逸，心安趣有余。\n石门动高韵，草堂新着书。\n骞飞久超绝，蹇足空踌躇。\n犹有昔时意，望君当照车。\n驱车当六国，何以须潜默。\n圣主常徵贤，羣公每举德。\n此时方独往，身志将何欲。\n愿谢山中人，廻车首归躅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}